cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the article below."
type: software
title: "Cu-acetate spin-density fit"
abstract: >-
  MATLAB code to fit a real-space spin-density model (anisotropic Gaussians)
  to 3D inelastic neutron scattering data of the triplet excitation in
  copper acetate.
authors:
